erent check — fix it. Print the row number in each test's output.\n\nVerify with: `cd /local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-dNzXE1/translation && timeout 600 cargo test --release --offline --test errors_3 -- --test-threads=1 2>&1 | tail -60`\n\nIf a test reveals a DIVERGENCE between C and Rust, do NOT fix translation/src — keep the failing test and report the exact divergence.\n\nFINAL REPORT (concise): a list `row N: pass|fail|unreachable-proxy` for rows 121-190, then the exact diverging output for any failures."}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1939,"cache_read_input_tokens":154014,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1939,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c8219bc-b0e9-40a9-995a-ed544487508c","uuid":"c7054bb0-dfde-454c-86fd-e706a9418829","timestamp":"2026-09-08T16:53:14.819Z"}
